(small external leaf definitions inline into executables; it fails on
upstream 644f4145c). Restated: executable = no library fill and no stack
traffic in f; -fPIC = interposable, must call; runtime f() == 0 in both
modes (a library-semantics fold returns 7: Clang 23.1.3 in every mode,
GCC 16.2 under -fPIC).
