Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 12:32:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 43/46] x86/i686 assembler: reject movs/movz register-size
 mismatches; widen movs[bw]q into %rax

GAS rejects movsbq/movswq with a 32-bit destination; the encoders accepted
it silently and the codegen emitted one such form. The encoders now check
source/destination widths for every movext mnemonic (casefiles against GAS
2.47: x86-64 16/0, i686 9/0) and the emitter widens into %rax.
gas_isa_scan.sh honours per-test .flags.
